    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 103,
        "text": "Hi, Tom! How was your visit to the new cultural heritage museum? I heard it's quite controversial.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "bf63afafca98a3478be61e4b0a3813745022c0d6133a607e73049d40faa148a9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 109,
        "sourceEnd": 363,
        "text": "Oh, it was fascinating, though I have mixed feelings. The exhibits are impressive, but some of the information panels seem oversimplified. For example, the section on ancient trade routes, which covers thousands of years, is squeezed into one small room.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "8021cba6ae98b8d25d258605b204c21c7982be8ac1a18e1a18523ae279ddca09",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 369,
        "sourceEnd": 520,
        "text": "That's a shame. I've read that the museum was designed by a famous architect who also worked on the national gallery. Did you like the building itself?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "3d47024b671678a7b3dabd325b23cc6cb5b097de8134fdde47f6cd6212036042",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 526,
        "sourceEnd": 732,
        "text": "Yes, the architecture is stunning. The glass roof, which lets in natural light, creates a lovely atmosphere. However, the layout is confusing. I got lost twice, even though there are maps at every entrance.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "d0adfda0f9adf60d9c63bc1421d1291ca8ab28396e803ca3e1fdf561f61f2b7e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 738,
        "sourceEnd": 823,
        "text": "I see. What about the interactive displays? I've heard they're popular with children.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "eb1ed98e80dccdaa9b15e0f6a5e31b8b27704fc7cd7c70077d0fefeb5c04ad57",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 829,
        "sourceEnd": 996,
        "text": "They are, but they often break down. While I was there, a digital screen showing traditional crafts wasn't working. Still, the staff were helpful and quickly fixed it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "dff2ca42f139be83fb2d1025e6062576eaada8beb3281e63196004b92483955c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1002,
        "sourceEnd": 1064,
        "text": "That's good. Did you learn anything new about Chinese culture?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "27bf418f8781fdbb3e2677f0f0c0e38d4f7827ceb4ee348989da97a81d4a96ff",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1070,
        "sourceEnd": 1287,
        "text": "Actually, yes. I didn't know that silk production was kept secret for centuries. The museum explains how the technique spread along the Silk Road, despite strict laws against exporting silkworms. That was eye-opening.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "8e8ccc0ed9d0e2392695fada45a8af0edd0b83f93e34e84935868ccc18ab64a3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1293,
        "sourceEnd": 1363,
        "text": "Interesting! I might visit next weekend. Is it worth the ticket price?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "2271ffbabafef12d0958190e33a0e629b938a6817b981d8ddea963f14e15b123",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1369,
        "sourceEnd": 1562,
        "text": "Well, the admission fee is 50 yuan, which is reasonable for such a large museum. But avoid weekends if you can—it gets extremely crowded. Also, the café is overpriced, so bring your own snacks.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "605f93d82f47067c78fb432363079b34b7cde8c78e54688a6c299cffb95dc920",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1568,
        "sourceEnd": 1667,
        "text": "Thanks for the tips. Oh, one more thing: did you see the special exhibition on ancient calligraphy?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "1cb9d1a27c100d5a1ee0772da6ef8d20fe5ae76e676867227f4b31434cbb6dd4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1673,
        "sourceEnd": 1889,
        "text": "I did, but it was disappointing. The lighting was too dim to read the descriptions, and many scrolls were copies rather than originals. Although the curator gave a passionate talk, the overall experience felt rushed.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "f578e2e77219fc04a80a52bab77fa801f17a1605531d43b5368d355fa03ec8a3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1895,
        "sourceEnd": 1996,
        "text": "That's unfortunate. Maybe I'll skip that part. Anyway, I should go. Thanks for sharing your thoughts!",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "28ba271db4796fd3473f751191af4a1172d0121118b935ad780bbf93130136d2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 2002,
        "sourceEnd": 2093,
        "text": "No problem. Let me know if you decide to go—I can lend you a guidebook that I bought there.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "cd20ccdf3879264f7f00529ca53802a2a76bc011be92a3366b0b323feaff401e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
